<title>UK: Premier Farnell profit rises 82 pct.</title>
<headline>Premier Farnell profit rises 82 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 2</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.1		   vs 35.6</p>
<p> Final dvidend (pence)  6.8		    vs 5.89</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.0		   vs 10.26</p>
<p> Pretax		     137.4		  vs 75.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   982.8		  vs 538.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Premier Farnell was formed in April 1996 when Britain's Farnell Electronics completed a $2.8 billion takeover of Premier -- a company twice its size.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profit between 132 and 140 million stg. The stated 1996 pre-tax profit figure is before an exceptional gain of 43.3 million stg on the disposal of Farnell Electronic Services in January.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
